{"chapter": "spaces", "node_kind": "lemma", "parent_tag": "04T8", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$S$", "MATH_0002": "$\\Sch_{fppf}$", "MATH_0003": "$F \\to H$", "MATH_0004": "$G \\to H$", "MATH_0005": "$S$", "MATH_0006": "$F \\times_H G$", "MATH_0007": "$S$"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{lemma}\n\\label{lemma-fibre-product-spaces}\n", "suffix": "\\end{lemma}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:45b0d781f62bf3b70579b95e96c85da44fa96f8de0492e35e52b269e4ed0cccd", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:42d4f8e83ce9a71d2f6afac62b193fc082aeca06c8060dfe2ec9bdc707ab4c30", "source_text": "Let <MATH_0001> be a scheme contained in <MATH_0002>.\nLet <MATH_0003>, <MATH_0004> be morphisms of algebraic spaces over <MATH_0005>.\nThen <MATH_0006> is an algebraic space, and is a fibre product\nin the category of algebraic spaces over <MATH_0007>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:2ba02aed96b9c67c1483482980777a7d09ae8f95789e88a6b755314b8585b8ca", "unit_id": "tag:02X2:statement"}
{"chapter": "spaces", "node_kind": "proof", "parent_tag": "04T8", "placeholders": {"MATH_0001": "$F \\times_H G$", "MATH_0002": "$F \\times_H G$", "MATH_0003": "$S$", "MATH_0004": "$(\\Sch/S)_{fppf}$", "REF_0001": "\\ref{lemma-fibre-product-spaces-over-sheaf-with-representable-diagonal}"}, "render": {"prefix": "\\begin{proof}\n", "suffix": "\\end{proof}"}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 1, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:973691c4767f821207db1e2fe911fd5b61f5f87a45dae25266e0351309ce248e", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:970528714afa853fc49221f677a5bcf3d4e918536aaeabfd86f1553c4ea75406", "source_text": "It follows from the stronger\nLemma <REF_0001>\nthat <MATH_0001> is an algebraic space.\nIt is clear that <MATH_0002>\nis a fibre product in the category of algebraic spaces over <MATH_0003>\nsince that is a full subcategory of the category\nof (pre)sheaves of sets on <MATH_0004>.\n", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3644baf9f2a3a0225804f8870ecd621f68018bd833ceebc46f22c134d8ae09ce", "unit_id": "tag:02X2:proof"}
